Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,You're halfway through a remote job application…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.60,0:00:03.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,and then you see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:05.60,Hot,,0,0,0,,US residents only.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:07.80,Cap,,0,0,400,,Remote doesn't always mean anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:09.10,Stat,,0,0,0,,683 of 1,765 remote jobs on our board\Nare open only to US residents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:09.10,Src,,0,0,0,,Yireh Careers board, 26 Nov 2026
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.80,0:00:09.80,Cap,,0,0,400,,That's why we built Yireh Careers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.10,0:00:11.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tell us where you live,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.70,0:00:13.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,and we'll show you remote jobs\Nthat say they're open to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:16.10,Cap,,0,0,400,,Every listing links to the original posting,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:18.60,Cap,,0,0,400,,so you can check the details\Nand when it was posted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:20.20,Hot,,0,0,0,,It's completely free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:22.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,We never charge you to apply.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.10,0:00:25.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Find remote jobs you can actually apply for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:26.80,Hot,,0,0,0,,Link in bio.
